    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank You For Your Application!</i> is a 'Dystopian Job Market Simulator' that is a satire of online job boards and the post-pandemic\u00a0job\u00a0market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Balance your\u00a0search\u00a0for gainful employment and working\u00a0odd\u00a0jobs\u00a0to keep the groceries coming in and your <strong>bills paid</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Manage your\u00a0physical\u00a0and mental\u00a0health\u00a0needs to\u00a0keep yourself from <strong>crashing out</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-File<i> hundreds</i> upon<i> thousands</i> of job applications with the desperate hope of finding a <strong>good job</strong>\u00a0that'll\u00a0let\u00a0you escape\u00a0the beige\u00a0prison\u00a0that\u00a0is\u00a0your\u00a0apartment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Deal with an <strong>evil landlord</strong> who could care less if you<strong> rot in the gutter</strong>!</p>",
